    "custom_html_i9kjfN": {
      "type": "custom-html",
      "settings": {
        "title": "",
        "html": "<div class=\"card__section expandable-content expandable-content--expandable\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"padding: 5px\">\n<div class=\"rte text--pull\">\n<h2>Unmatched Selection:</h2>\n<p>At Hearns Hobbies, we understand that every model railway enthusiast has their own unique vision. That's why we offer a vast selection of Bachmann Branchline models, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/locomotives-sets\">Locomotives</a>: From iconic steam engines to modern diesel locomotives, we have a wide range of models to power your railway.</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/rolling-stock\">Rolling Stock</a>: Populate your railway with a variety of passenger carriages, freight wagons, and service vehicles.</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/scenery-railway\">Track and Scenery</a>: Build your dream layout with a complete selection of track components, bridges, tunnels, and realistic scenery elements.</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/track-accessories\">Accessories</a>: Add the finishing touches to your layout with a comprehensive range of figures, signals, and other detailing accessories.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>The Hearns Hobbies Advantage:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Unbeatable Prices</b>: We offer competitive prices on all Bachmann Branchline products.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Expert Advice</b>: Our knowledgeable staff is passionate about model railways and happy to answer your questions and help you find the perfect products for your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Fast and Reliable Shipping</b>: We get your hobby supplies to you quickly and safely.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Hassle-Free Exchange</b>: We offer a no-questions-asked exchange policy for your peace of mind.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Quality Craftsmanship</b>: Bachmann Branchline models are renowned for their exceptional quality and craftsmanship. Each piece is carefully crafted using high-quality materials and precision engineering techniques, ensuring durability and realism.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Authentic Replicas</b>: From locomotives to scenery, Bachmann Branchline models are faithful replicas of their real-life counterparts. Whether you're a history buff or a railway enthusiast, you'll appreciate the attention to detail and authenticity of our products.</li>\n<li><b>Wide Range of Products: With a diverse range of locomotives, carriages, wagons, buildings, and accessories, Bachmann Branchline offers something for every model railway enthusiast. Whether you're building a small layout or a sprawling diorama, you'll find everything you need to bring your vision to life.</b></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<button class=\" expandable-content__toggle\" style=\"padding:5px\">                             <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-icon\"></span>                         <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-text\" data-view-more=\"View more\" data-view-less=\"View less\">View more</span>                    \n<p></p></button>\n</div>"
      }
    },
